{"id":9050953,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/merge_requests/4822","number":4822,"state":"merged","title":"fix(asinh): improve large-value precision","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/4822","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/4822/issues","body":"## 描述\n\n修复 Asinh 在中大数值区间的精度问题。\n\n原有实现对所有非小值统一使用 `log(u) * r / (u - 1)` 补偿；该补偿在中大数值区间会额外引入约 1～2 ULP 误差。本次改动按输入绝对值进行分段处理：\n\n- `|x| < 10`：保留原有 `log1p` 补偿路径，保证小值精度；\n- `10 <= |x| < 2^28`：直接保留 `log(u)`，避免额外乘除带来的精度损失；\n- `|x| >= 2^28`：使用 `log(|x|) + ln(2) + 1 / |x|^2` 渐近式，避免 `u ≈ 2|x|` 溢出；\n- 保留 NaN 传播语义。\n\n## 关联的Issue\n\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/issues/2734\n\n## 测试\n\n- 使用 Asinh 对应的 golden 和测试用例完成三方精度测试；\n- 修改后的 Asinh 三方精度测试全部通过；\n- 覆盖 FP32、FP16、BF16 及中值、大值、极大值和 NaN 场景。\n\n## 文档更新\n\n无文档更新。\n\n## 类型标签\n\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n","assignees_number":16,"assignees":[{"id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","login":"songkai111","name":"songkai111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/songkai111","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"682accc0a6508e17e040cd22","login":"zhangzijie","name":"zhangzijie","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangzijie","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822dffae4b985165b4b112b","login":"loov1","name":"loov","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/loov1","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68d10be46073b92eb7722836","login":"zhanw_coding","name":"zhanw_coding","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/af/1b59fa26fc66d8f2fb2c2ae63bb567faa986617b7b8600ad716afe7696d65511.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhanw_coding","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c0d3b72f80710bcb7e8de5","login":"gubaocheng","name":"gubaocheng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gubaocheng","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6861e8ed543b5b402353431b","login":"zl_hw","name":"zl_hw","html_url":"https://git